    "tooltip": "**Settled: narrow by design.** Risk here is a fundamentals-and-tone number. Momentum and insider buying are *conviction*, not risk — that is how the desk thinks, not an accident of wiring.\n\nWhich means the Risk Deep-Dive is named after the narrow number, and that is fine.\n\n2.5% VaR is an **alert** off this box, not a filter."
   },
   "fillStyle": "solid",
