   "customData": {
    "author": "agent",
    "kind": "sink",
    "role": "node",
    "tooltip": "**Correction to my last guess.** I had 2.5% drawn as a filter at the risk model. It isn't — nothing is dropped. The number comes out of the risk model and crossing 2.5% *tells you*.\n\nThat makes this the only path in the whole system that reaches a human without going through Compose, the reports, or the dashboard. It is the one thing that can wake someone up."
   },
